             suffixes.  The --ii flag requests display of inode information in
             addition to capacity information.  This command is only supported
             on servers that implement the “statvfs@openssh.com” extension.

     eexxiitt    Quit ssffttpp.

     ggeett [--aaffppRR] _r_e_m_o_t_e_-_p_a_t_h [_l_o_c_a_l_-_p_a_t_h]
             Retrieve the _r_e_m_o_t_e_-_p_a_t_h and store it on the local machine.  If
             the local path name is not specified, it is given the same name
